    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pour moi, le Pokémon le plus fabuleux et le plus\nfort du monde...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕī",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 216,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006F007500720020006D006F0069002C0020006C006500200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E0020006C006500200070006C0075007300200066006100620075006C0065007500780020006500740020006C006500200070006C00750073000A0066006F007200740020006400750020006D006F006E00640065002E002E002E001000020114012B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "... c’est Coconfort !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕī",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "002E002E002E00200063201900650073007400200043006F0063006F006E0066006F0072007400200021001000020114012B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Et moi, je veux avoir la meilleure équipe de\nCoconfort ! Tu veux bien m’aider à m’entraîner ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕī",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Viens me voir quand tu seras prêt<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe à combattre !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕī",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005600690065006E00730020006D006500200076006F006900720020007100750061006E006400200074007500200073006500720061007300200070007200EA007400100003110000FF01000065002000E000200063006F006D00620061007400740072006500200021001000020114012B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "T’es prêt<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe à affronter mes Coconfort ? Tu vas voir,\nils ont trop la classe !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕī",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Prêt<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 904,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050007200EA007400100003110000FF01000065002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Laisse-moi deux minutes !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C00610069007300730065002D006D006F0069002000640065007500780020006D0069006E0075007400650073002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’avais super envie de te montrer mes Coconfort...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕī",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A20190061007600610069007300200073007500700065007200200065006E0076006900650020006400650020007400650020006D006F006E00740072006500720020006D0065007300200043006F0063006F006E0066006F00720074002E002E002E001000020114012B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Youpi, merci !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕī",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1096,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F007500700069002C0020006D006500720063006900200021001000020114012B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Admire mes Coconfort !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕī",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410064006D0069007200650020006D0065007300200043006F0063006F006E0066006F0072007400200021001000020114012B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "T’es vraiment très fort<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe. C’était un bon\nentraînement pour mes Coconfort.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕī",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Par contre, j’espère qu’ils ont pas gagné trop\nde Points d’Expérience !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕī",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh non... Mon Coconfort a évolué en\nDardargnan.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕī",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F00680020006E006F006E002E002E002E0020004D006F006E00200043006F0063006F006E0066006F0072007400200061002000E90076006F006C007500E900200065006E000A0044006100720064006100720067006E0061006E002E001000020114012B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je pourrai plus avoir la meilleure équipe de\nCoconfort, maintenant...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕī",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A006500200070006F0075007200720061006900200070006C00750073002000610076006F006900720020006C00610020006D00650069006C006C0065007500720065002000E900710075006900700065002000640065000A0043006F0063006F006E0066006F00720074002C0020006D00610069006E00740065006E0061006E0074002E002E002E001000020114012B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais je peux peut-être essayer d’avoir la meilleure\néquipe de Dardargnan ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕī",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bon, au fond, c’est pas très grave. Maintenant,\nje sais que les Pokémon Insecte évoluent vite.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕī",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1936,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je vais tâcher de profiter à fond du peu de temps\noù ce sont des Coconfort !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕī",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu peux choisir de ne pas les faire évoluer.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054007500200070006500750078002000630068006F00690073006900720020006400650020006E006500200070006100730020006C00650073002000660061006900720065002000E90076006F006C007500650072002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu veux dire qu’à moins que je choisisse de faire\névoluer mes Pokémon, ils ne sont pas censés<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nle faire ? Mais alors, les miens sont spéciaux ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕī",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 150
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est bon à savoir, en tout cas !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nMais, du coup, est-ce que je veux plutôt une\néquipe de Coconfort ou de Dardargnan ?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nC’est beaucoup trop difficile de choisir !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕī",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 171
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Les Pokémon de ton équipe n’évolueront pas,\nà moins que tu choisisses de les faire évoluer.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕī",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
